ts/ticket-005.md): Regional Jurisdiction Lineage and Cross-Jurisdiction Comparative GraphRAG Traversal \u0026 Context Assembly\n\n---\n\n### Changed Files\n\n1. [`src/api/routes.py`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T185957-734-5ytd/src/api/routes.py#L84-L320) (`ticket-001`):\n   - Added `jurisdiction_filter` query parameter alongside `state_filter` on [`get_graph_topology`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T185957-734-5ytd/src/api/routes.py#L85-L320) with fail-fast HTTP 400 validation against Neo4j (`EntityResolutionError`).\n   - Implemented multi-tier topology filtering for National Overview (`155` non-fee nodes), Jurisdiction-Level filtering (`JURIS-DME-*` + covered `State` nodes with collapsed fee schedules), and State-Level filtering (`STATE-*` + parent `JURIS-DME-*` + 71 non-rural `FeeScheduleEntry` nodes = `171` nodes).\n2. [`src/frontend/src/context/GraphSyncContext.tsx`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T185957-734-5ytd/src/frontend/src/context/GraphSyncContext.tsx#L17-L440) (`ticket-002`):\n   - Defined and exported [`DME_JURISDICTIONS`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T185957-734-5ytd/src/frontend/src/context/GraphSyncContext.tsx#L32-L122), [`STATE_TO_JURISDICTION`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T185957-734-5ytd/src/frontend/src/context/GraphSyncContext.tsx#L124-L132), and [`ALL_STATES_SORTED`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T185957-734-5ytd/src/frontend/src/context/GraphSyncContext.tsx#L134-L142) covering all 4 CMS DME MAC Jurisdictions and 53 US states/territories.\n   - Added `filterJurisdiction`, `availableStates`, and `setFilterJurisdiction` to [`GraphSyncProvider`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T185957-734-5ytd/src/frontend/src/context/GraphSyncContext.tsx#L174-L438) with bidirectional cascading between jurisdiction and state selectors, automatic parent jurisdiction reflection when a state is selected, and regional subgraph illumination (`JURIS-DME-*` and `COVERS_STATE` edges).\n3. [`src/frontend/src/App.tsx`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T185957-734-5ytd/src/frontend/src/App.tsx#L16-L115) (`ticket-002`, `ticket-003`):\n   - Updated [`fetchTopology`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T185957-734-5ytd/src/frontend/src/App.tsx#L16-L70) to accept `jurisdictionFilter` and pass `jurisdiction_filter` and `state_filter` to `/api/graph/topology`, defaulting initial mount to the 60 FPS National Overview (`fetchTopology('', 'LTA', '')`).\n4. [`src/frontend/src/components/FilterToolbar.tsx`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T185957-734-5ytd/src/frontend/src/components/FilterToolbar.tsx#L9-L135) (`ticket-003`):\n   - Replaced the single conflated dropdown with two dedicated selectors: `JURISDICTION:` (`All Jurisdictions (National Overview)` and `Jurisdiction A/B/C/D`) and `STATE:` (`All States (Overview)` and dynamically cascaded `availableStates`).\n5. [`src/graphrag/models.py`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T185957-734-5ytd/src/graphrag/models.py#L58-L66) (`ticket-004`):\n   - Added optional `jurisdiction_code: Optional[str] = None` to [`GraphRAGQueryRequest`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T185957-734-5ytd/src/graphrag/models.py#L58-L66).\n6. [`src/graphrag/entity_linker.py`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T185957-734-5ytd/src/graphrag/entity_linker.py#L15-L470) (`ticket-004`):\n   - Implemented [`_extract_state_anchors`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T185957-734-5ytd/src/graphrag/entity_linker.py#L392-L475) to extract all non-overla